  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Mizzima) Women in Myanmar Society Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) To encourage women
and strengthen their participation in the peace process and political decision
making; 2) To create awareness among the people of Myanmar on women&#x2019;s
capability and strength in all spheres of life; 3) To enhance understanding among
the people of Myanmar on gender equality and GBV issues and domestic as well as
international laws on women; 4) To advocate for the adoption of the Protection
of Violence Against Women Law and effective implementation of the National
Strategic Plan for the Advancement of Women</narrative>
  </description>
